		{
			dependencies: [
				"2B4F44E19AA7A1B6"
				"72861B317663600B"
			]
			description: [
				"The final step. Combine &6Pulsating Dust&r and &6Clay&r to make &6Pulsating Prediction Matrix&r. "
				""
				"Take note that a &3&3Chemical Reactor&r making &6Resonant Clathrate&r will supply 1 &3Alloy Smelter&r of the same tier, and that one &bMV &3Alloy Smelter&r making &6Pulsating Prediction Matrix&r supports 10.03 &3Simulation Chambers&r, with each higher tier doubling the amount of &3Simulation Chambers&r it supports."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&eTo prevent flooding your alloy smelter with too much &6Clay&e or &6Pulsating Dust&e. Put 2 item containers(for example, &6Chest&e or a &bSophisticated Storage&6 Barrel&e) next to the alloy smelter, and put robot arms on the alloy smelter facing the chests, set them to import and keep exact, and set the amount to keep to 64 or less."
				""
				"{image:ftblibrary:textures/gui/ppm_robot_arm_how_to.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
			]
			id: "261F7D50E23B0789"
			optional: true
			size: 2.0d
			subtitle: "[\"\",{\"italic\":\"true\",\"text\":\"This step requires a \"},{\"italic\":\"true\",\"bold\":\"true\",\"text\":\"Alloy Smelter\"},{\"italic\":\"true\",\"text\":\" at \"},{\"italic\":\"true\",\"bold\":\"true\",\"text\":\"LV\"},{\"italic\":\"true\",\"text\":\" or higher.\"}]"
			tasks: [{
				id: "6D25E047579465DD"
				item: "hostilenetworks:prediction_matrix"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: -4.0d
			y: 4.25d
		}
		{
