		{
			description: ["There are many ways to procure &9Water&r, but the most notable are: &3Water Collectors&r, which are very slow but cheap; &bThermal &3Aqueous Accumulators&r, which are a bit more expensive but way faster; and &bGregTech &3Infinite Water Covers&r, which are much more expensive, but save space because they're covers, and make water 16x faster than &3Accumulators&r.\n\nRight now, you should probably use the &3Aqueous Accumulator&r."]
