		{
			description: [
				"&9Lava&r can be obtained in two main ways. The first is using a &3Chemical Reactor&r to turn &6Magma Blocks&r into &9Lava&r. The second is using a &bGregTech &6Fluid Drill&r in the Nether above a &9Lava&r vein."
				""
				"In this case you'll need &9Lava&r for &6Netherrack&r, although &9Lava&r can also be centrifuged for useful resources like &6Tantalite&r, &6Gold&r, and &6Sapphire&r."
			]
