		{
			dependencies: ["21654B6E703A2923"]
			description: [
				"Break up your &6Sandstone&r into &6Saltpeter&r. This is probably the best way to get &6Saltpeter&r, which you'll need a lot of for &6Aerotheum Dust&r. If you are playing Normal Mode, you can also get &6Saltpeter&r from &bHostile Neural Networks&r."
				""
				"You can also electrolyze it for &6Potassium&r, although that isn't recommended because of how easily you can get &6Potassium&r from other sources and how much &6Saltpeter&r it costs."
			]
			id: "1349FBBCE3041081"
