					}
				}
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Saltpeter, Coal, and Oil"
			x: 3.0d
			y: -7.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["59CC348BC6199793"]
			description: [
				"[\"\",{\"text\":\"To gather \"},{\"color\":\"gold\",\"text\":\"Wood\"},{\"text\":\" at the scale you'll require, you'll have to start off with the \"},{\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true,\"text\":\"Phytogenic Insolator\",\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"2607F8404B56773B\"}},{\"text\":\" and should upgrade to a \"},{\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true,\"text\":\"Greenhouse\",\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"3A71D736AE5C17E2\"}},{\"text\":\" when you unlock it.\"}]"
				""
				"Both options require &9Water&r and energy to operate, and accept &6Fertilizer&r to boost output - the &3Greenhouse&r is just far faster."
			]
			id: "0E8C258BD7E36154"
			size: 2.0d
			subtitle: "&oPunching trees won't cut it.&r"
			tasks: [{
				id: "10903B2BD99A6BDE"
				item: {
					Count: 1
					id: "itemfilters:tag"
					tag: {
						value: "minecraft:logs"
					}
				}
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Wood"
			x: 4.0d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			description: ["&6Saplings&r can be dropped when breaking leaves of the corresponding type of tree.\n\nYou'll want to aim for &6Rubber saplings&r in particular, since they provide &6Sticky Resin&r when harvested."]
			id: "59CC348BC6199793"
			tasks: [{
				id: "7FCB53B3E3E4F56C"
				item: {
					Count: 1
					id: "itemfilters:tag"
					tag: {
						value: "minecraft:saplings"
					}
				}
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Sapling"
			x: 3.0d
			y: 5.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: [
				"59CC348BC6199793"
				"0E8C258BD7E36154"
			]
			description: ["If you chose to cultivate &6Rubber Saplings&r, then you will receive &6Sticky Resin&r as a product. &3Centrifuging&r the &rRubber Logs&r you get will net you some extra, alongside &6Carbon Dust&r and &9Methane&r.\n\nThis substance is wonderfully versatile, especially in Early Game. You should definitely passively produce this."]
			id: "2BF1E9CC0D7F7C91"
			subtitle: "[\"\",{\"italic\":\"true\",\"text\":\"This step requires a \"},{\"italic\":\"true\",\"bold\":\"true\",\"text\":\"Phytogenic Insolator\"},{\"italic\":\"true\",\"text\":\" or \"},{\"italic\":\"true\",\"bold\":\"true\",\"text\":\"Greenhouse\"},{\"italic\":\"true\",\"text\":\" or \"},{\"italic\":\"true\",\"bold\":\"true\",\"text\":\"Centrifuge\"},{\"italic\":\"true\",\"text\":\" at \"},{\"italic\":\"true\",\"bold\":\"true\",\"text\":\"LV\"},{\"italic\":\"true\",\"text\":\" or higher.\"}]"
			tasks: [{
				id: "2A48AD6742E0AF73"
				item: "gtceu:sticky_resin"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 4.0d
			y: 6.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: [
				"59CC348BC6199793"
				"2BF1E9CC0D7F7C91"
			]
			description: ["Most forms of plant matter can be crafted or compacted into &6Plant Balls&r. They are generally more useful when &3macerated&r into &6Bio Chaff&r."]
			id: "345470975C5570B7"
			subtitle: "[\"\",{\"italic\":\"true\",\"text\":\"This step requires a \"},{\"italic\":\"true\",\"bold\":\"true\",\"text\":\"Compressor\"},{\"italic\":\"true\",\"text\":\" or \"},{\"italic\":\"true\",\"bold\":\"true\",\"text\":\"Centrifuge\"},{\"italic\":\"true\",\"text\":\" at \"},{\"italic\":\"true\",\"bold\":\"true\",\"text\":\"LV\"},{\"italic\":\"true\",\"text\":\" or higher.\"}]"
			tasks: [{
