		{
			dependencies: ["2BF1E9CC0D7F7C91"]
			description: ["&9Glue&r can be centrifuged from &6Sticky Resin&r. This is the simplest recipe for the stuff, and the cheapest unless you have a surplus of certain chemicals.\n\n&9Glue&r itself has several applications, most of which are &3Assembler&r counterparts to recipes performed in a &3Crafting Table&r."]
			icon: "gtceu:glue_bucket"
			id: "519389755420A7A8"
