				"779632FC75C4FE6C"
			]
			description: [
				"With enough processing, you can make &6Fertilizer&r from &6Saplings&r, &6Logs&r and &9Water&r. This lets you boost your plant-growing machines, multiplying their output."
				""
				"However, it can be difficult to produce large quantities of &6Fertilizer&r this way. Consider using alternative methods if you need more than you can produce with this approach."
			]
			id: "483A64A744DA61C5"
