		{
			dependencies: ["3B1873913255E7C0"]
			description: ["When sourcing &9Ethanol&r from &9Biomass&r, you should use a &3Distillery&r instead of a &3Distillation Tower&r - the extra &9Water&r byproduct is not worth the larger footprint and reduced &6Wood Pulp&r output."]
