		{
			dependencies: ["0E8C258BD7E36154"]
			description: ["With a &3Pyrolyse Oven&r, you can bake &6Logs&r for &9Charcoal Byproducts&r or any of its distillates. Once you hit &6HV&r, these can be further distilled and processed into useful chemicals like &9Toluene&r, &9Phenol&r, &9Benzene&r, &9Methanol&r, &9Acetone&r, &9Acetic Acid&r, and others."]
